WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.963
Mara came out of Gumdrop Candy Store.

2
00:00:08.964 --> 00:00:12.043
She was chewing bubble gum.

3
00:00:12.044 --> 00:00:18.701
"Mmm," said Mara. "This new bubble gum is delicious!"

4
00:00:18.702 --> 00:00:22.786
Mara blew a bubble.

5
00:00:22.787 --> 00:00:25.280
The bubble grew and grew.

6
00:00:25.281 --> 00:00:29.104
"Why isn't this bubble popping?" Mara wondered.

7
00:00:29.105 --> 00:00:32.993
The bubble grew bigger and bigger.

8
00:00:32.994 --> 00:00:36.349
Soon it was bigger than a car!

9
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:41.019
Mara screamed. "Ahh!"

10
00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.571
"I can't wait to play kickball," said Jack.

11
00:00:44.572 --> 00:00:48.467
Roxy, Terrell, and Jack were walking to Metro City Park.

12
00:00:48.468 --> 00:00:51.306
Jack was carrying his brand-new rubber ball.

13
00:00:51.307 --> 00:00:55.538
"Mara is meeting us at the park at two o'clock," said Roxy.

14
00:00:55.539 --> 00:01:03.573
"She said she had to finish her book report first."

15
00:01:03.574 --> 00:01:09.595
At the park the three friends played kickball for a while.

16
00:01:09.596 --> 00:01:12.420
Then they got a drink from the water fountain.

17
00:01:12.421 --> 00:01:15.032
Mara still wasn't there.

18
00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:17.664
"What time is it?" asked Jack.

19
00:01:17.665 --> 00:01:19.925
Terrell looked at his watch.

20
00:01:19.926 --> 00:01:22.541
"It's after two o'clock," he said.

21
00:01:22.542 --> 00:01:25.214
"Mara should be here."

22
00:01:25.215 --> 00:01:28.593
"I'm sure she'll be here soon," said Roxy.

23
00:01:28.594 --> 00:01:32.736
"Jack, kick the ball to me!"

24
00:01:32.737 --> 00:01:38.178
Roxy ran back across the field.

25
00:01:38.179 --> 00:01:40.148
Jack kicked the ball.

26
00:01:40.149 --> 00:01:42.897
It sailed through the air.

27
00:01:42.898 --> 00:01:46.539
"Got it!" called Roxy.

28
00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.566
She kicked the ball to Terrell.

29
00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:50.224
It went over his head.

30
00:01:50.225 --> 00:01:53.909
"You kicked it too hard!" Terrell called.

31
00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:57.648
He chased after the ball.

32
00:01:57.649 --> 00:02:05.238
The three friends kicked the ball back and forth for a while longer.

33
00:02:05.239 --> 00:02:09.167
But after thirty more minutes, Mara was still not there.

34
00:02:09.168 --> 00:02:12.884
"I wonder where Mara is," said Terrell.

35
00:02:12.885 --> 00:02:17.311
"Maybe she was kidnapped by aliens!" said Jack.

36
00:02:17.312 --> 00:02:22.898
Terrell laughed. "Maybe a big swamp monster attacked her!"

37
00:02:22.899 --> 00:02:26.807
"Ha-ha! Or a lava monster!" said Jack.

38
00:02:26.808 --> 00:02:30.146
"Or a giant octopus!"

39
00:02:30.147 --> 00:02:32.064
Roxy shook her head.

40
00:02:32.065 --> 00:02:37.959
"I doubt Mara was attacked by aliens or a monster or a giant octopus.

41
00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:41.910
She's probably still working on her book report."

42
00:02:41.911 --> 00:02:44.243
Terrell rubbed his chin.

43
00:02:44.244 --> 00:02:48.352
"Maybe Rocket Girl can find Mara," he said.

44
00:02:48.353 --> 00:02:54.319
Roxy laughed. "We don't need Rocket Girl to find Mara."

45
00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:57.482
"But Mara is missing," said Terrell.

46
00:02:57.483 --> 00:02:59.933
"This might be serious!"

47
00:02:59.934 --> 00:03:03.679
"I'm sure Mara is fine," said Roxy.

48
00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.492
"She's probably just—"

49
00:03:05.493 --> 00:03:09.490
Roxy's watch beeped.

50
00:03:09.491 --> 00:03:18.820
"Oh!" said Roxy. "I . . . um, need to go tie my shoe."

51
00:03:18.821 --> 00:03:22.649
Roxy went over to a park bench and sat down.

52
00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:26.329
She pressed a button on her watch.

53
00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:30.759
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered. "What's wrong?"

54
00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:33.156
The mayor looked nervous.

55
00:03:33.157 --> 00:03:38.946
"Rocket Girl! A giant pink blob is invading downtown Metro City!

56
00:03:38.947 --> 00:03:41.048
We need your help!"

57
00:03:41.049 --> 00:03:43.354
"Whoa," said Roxy.

58
00:03:43.355 --> 00:03:47.541
"A pink blob! Don't worry, Mayor.

59
00:03:47.542 --> 00:03:53.780
Rocket Girl is on her way!"

